# Trained model artifacts.
#
# The Phase 1 hybrid model + envelopes are small (~1.5 MB total) and
# committed so a fresh clone can run `make scan-trace` immediately. Any
# LARGER trained artifacts (raw checkpoints, older experimental models,
# .pth files) are still ignored.
models/*.pth
models/checkpoints/*.pt
# Keep: scbf_hybrid_v2.pt, envelope_v2*.{npy,json}, checkpoints/split_info.json

# Dataset (too large to commit - place manually or via scripts/collect_zenodo.py)
data/zenodo_13746167/*/traces/*.jsonl
data/zenodo_13746167/*/data/*.jsonl
data/zenodo_13746167/**/.tmp_traces/

# Any temporary trace file
last_capture.jsonl
scbf_data.zip
SCBF.zip

